//=======================================================================
//=======================================================================
// None of below actors are used by mod itself
// They are here to ensure that folks don't load incompatible Decorate mods
// It's done by inheriting actor classes from other decorate files
//
// When a new QC:DE version is released, make sure to increase the version number
// in changed Decorate files, and reflect the change here too
//=======================================================================
//=======================================================================

